the biggest loser at the racecourse,

17:34.850 --> 17:38.500
and then they interviewed the people 
who add the censors to porn videos...

17:38.500 --> 17:42.370
I love how they push the envelope 
with the topics they cover.

17:43.330 --> 17:44.620
My personal favorite was the one

17:44.620 --> 17:48.830
with the undercover report on an exploitative 
company's employee stand-up comedy event.

17:48.830 --> 17:52.090
