18:09.520 --> 18:13.770
Hey, no! He already has a lovely girlfriend!

18:13.770 --> 18:16.900
I'm not going to make 
any moves on him or anything.

18:16.900 --> 18:18.540
I just think he's charismatic.

18:19.030 --> 18:22.860
If we get too friendly, I won't be able 
to enjoy his show anymore.

18:22.860 --> 18:25.940
As a fan, I prefer to keep my distance.

18:27.640 --> 18:30.620
Either way, if things keep going well,

18:30.620 --> 18:33.790
we'll probably get to work 
together at some point.

18:34.590 --> 18:36.720
Yeah, that could definitely happen.

18:37.480 --> 18:39.810
I'm not just talking about Aqua-san.

18:40.430 --> 18:43.230
Ruby, Minami, you two are 
getting more popular as well.

18:43.680 --> 18:47.880
I think we'll be working together 
sooner rather than later.

18:49.190 --> 18:54.700
Me, gettin' to work with <i>the</i> Frill Shiranui? 
I dunno about that...

18:55.080 --> 18:56.910
I'm certainly looking forward to it.

19:00.350 --> 19:04.570
Ruby, you'll probably get to work 
with yer bro soon enough.

19:04.570 --> 19:07.830
