20:05.000 --> 20:11.250
Man, I didn't know Aqua-kun 
had such a cute little sister.

20:11.250 --> 20:13.600
Being a looker must run in the family.

20:13.600 --> 20:15.400
Thank you.

20:18.880 --> 20:21.820
You got me good, Kaburagi-san.

20:22.380 --> 20:27.210
I didn't mean it as a prank or anything, 
but that was a great reaction.

20:27.210 --> 20:28.700
That's not what I'm—

20:28.700 --> 20:31.460
You hide your true self well. Almost too well.

20:31.780 --> 20:37.410
Viewers'll surely find you more relatable 
after seeing how you act around family.

20:37.890 --> 20:41.820
It might not be a bad idea to put 
yourselves out there as twins.

20:43.530 --> 20:47.020
Your sister's quite calculating.

20:48.540 --> 20:51.050
Wait, this wasn't your doing?

20:51.050 --> 20:52.580
Nope, it wasn't.

20:52.580 --> 20:55.840
Ruby-kun brought the idea to me.

20:57.200 --> 20:59.950
When did that happen?

20:59.950 --> 21:03.730
At a B-Komachi concert I was invited to.

21:04.140 --> 21:07.670
She said, "Don't you think this would be fun?"

21:07.670 --> 21:10.240
She even had a pitch deck all ready.

21:11.270 --> 21:14.360
She'll go far if she has that in her.

21:14.360 --> 21:21.220
Talent and tireless hard work isn't 
the only way to make it in this business.

21:21.750 --> 21:25.140
Behind-the-scenes maneuvering 
can also go a long way.

21:25.140 --> 21:29.560
You'll always have cards to play 
in the right time and situation.

21:30.280 --> 21:35.400
The ability to recognize and act on them 
is a powerful asset to any entertainer.

21:35.790 --> 21:40.320
Of course, I only used Ruby-kun 
because I liked the pitch.

21:40.320 --> 21:43.750
Anything goes, as long as it's fun. 
That's TV for you.

21:44.350 --> 21:46.030
Ruby made a pitch deck?

21:46.750 --> 21:50.960
She didn't seem capable of this 
when I met her before.

21:51.950 --> 21:56.090
I wonder if Strawberry Productions 
gained a good advisor.

22:08.080 --> 22:09.470
Catch anything,

22:10.040 --> 22:12.340
Ichigo Saitou-san?

